text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'Amplify 3 (As this creature enters the battlefield, put three +1/+1 counters on it for each Dragon card you reveal in your hand.)\\nFlying\\n{T}: Kilnmouth Dragon deals damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to any target.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\n{R}: Fire-Belly Changeling gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than twice each turn.', 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to any target, 2 damage to another target, and 3 damage to a third target.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 and have reach. (They can block creatures with flying.)', 'Defender\\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", 'Dragon spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each Mountain you control and has first strike.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, create a 2/2 white Griffin creature token with flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', 'Exile target creature that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nOther Knight creatures you control get +1/+1 and have indestructible. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nProtection from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black.)", 'First strike, protection from red', 'First strike\\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'First strike\\nWhen Knight of the White Orchid enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Target Knight creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Bogardan Rager enters the battlefield, target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Bogardan Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{1}{R}: Shivan Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target.", 'Flying, first strike', "Flying, first strike (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach, and it deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", 'Flying\\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhen Voracious Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals damage to any target equal to twice the number of Goblins it devoured.', 'Flying\\nWhen Thunder Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}: Mordant Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhenever Mordant Dragon deals combat damage to a player, you may have it deal that much damage to target creature that player controls.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Ghostfire is colorless.\\nGhostfire deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Grasslands enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Grasslands: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'If you control four or fewer lands, search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nCycling—Sacrifice a land. (Sacrifice a land, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Jaws of Stone deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets, where X is the number of Mountains you control as you cast this spell.', 'Kicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell.)\\nBreath of Darigaaz deals 1 damage to each creature without flying and each player. If this spell was kicked, it deals 4 damage to each creature without flying and each player instead.', 'Kicker {2}{W} (You may pay an additional {2}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nIf Benalish Lancer was kicked, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it and with first strike.', 'Knight creatures you control have double strike.', 'Knight of the Reliquary gets +1/+1 for each land card in your graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Forest or Plains: Search your library for a land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Level up {2} ({2}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n2/2\\nLEVEL 5+\\n5/5\\nFirst strike', 'Level up {2}{W} ({2}{W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-4\\n3/6\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n4/8\\nOther creatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n2/3\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\nFlying, vigilance', 'Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn. For each 1 damage prevented this way, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Punishing Fire deals 2 damage to any target.\\nWhenever an opponent gains life, you may pay {R}. If you do, return Punishing Fire from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Red creatures you control have first strike.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Add {R}.', 'Seismic Strike deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target player gains 7 life.', 'The next 2 damage that a source of your choice would deal to you and/or permanents you control this turn is dealt to any target instead.', "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Untap target creature with power less than the number of cards in your graveyard and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Until end of turn, target creature you control gets +3/+3 and other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\\n{4}{W}: Lionheart Maverick gets +1/+2 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Whenever Alaborn Cavalier attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever Knotvine Paladin attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each untapped creature you control.', 'Whenever Paladin of Prahv deals damage, you gain that much life.\\nForecast — {1}{W}, Reveal Paladin of Prahv from your hand: Whenever target creature deals damage this turn, you gain that much life. (Activate only during your upkeep and only once each turn.)', 'Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature and a +1/+1 counter on Juniper Order Ranger.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}: Henge Guardian gains trample until end of turn.', '{R}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"At harvest are seeds of next year sown."', '"By tradition, we don\'t speak for two days after battle. If our deeds won\'t speak for themselves, what else could be said?"', '"Command is the act of balancing on a vine and convincing others that it is firm ground."\\n—Sidar Jabari', '"Course he ran! *I* wouldn\'t want to stare down that barrel, either!"\\n—Alaborn soldier', '"Fear this no more!"', '"For unwavering commitment and unflinching strength, the Order of the White Orchid confers its sigil. Rise, knight-captain, and do your duty."', '"Hammer out your doubts as you forge your weapon. To slay a dragon, your resolve must be stronger than your steel."', '"He is part of a new breed of guardian, one who embraces the best of both his world and ours."\\n—Mayael the Anima', '"I like goblins. They make funny little popping sounds when they die."\\n—Braids, dementia summoner', '"If you think you are brave enough to walk the path of honor, follow me into the dragon\'s den."', '"Just as the noble soul calls virtue to itself, the evil soul summons harm."\\n—Teachings of Eight-and-a-Half-Tails', '"Kills and cooks your food in one easy stroke."', '"Life up here is simple. Adapt to the ways of the mountains and they will reward you. Fight them and they will end you."\\n—Kezim, prodigal pyromancer', '"My ears say it hisses. My fingers say it burns."\\n—Auntie Wort', '"Swords may sunder. Shields may fail. My will is stronger than steel, and my flesh and bone far more deadly."', '"The smell of roasted flesh hung over the valley for hours."\\n—Onean sergeant', '"The southern fortress taken by invaders? Heh, sure . . . when elephants fly."\\n—Brezard Skeinbow, captain of the guard', '"Tusks to splinter skulls. Steel to shatter scale."\\n—Warhammer inscription', '"We leonin have come to rule the plains by taking to the skies."\\n—Raksha Golden Cub', '"We speak the dragons\' language of flame and rage. They speak our language of fury and honor. Together we shall weave a tale of destruction without equal."', '"Within each of you is the strength of a landslide."\\n—Kumano, to his pupils', '"You helped save my people from a Phyrexian fate. Did you think I wouldn\'t return the favor?"\\n—Eladamri, to Gerrard', '"Your signet is no symbol of power. It marks only your need for numbers to aid you. What do you do, guild-rat, now that you face my blade alone?"', "A dragon's scale can be carved into a mighty shield, provided you can procure a dragontooth to cut it.", 'Ambidexterity is common among kithkin. The thoughtweft links the minds of the left- and right-handed, giving each the knack of the other.', 'Boggarts divide the world into two categories: things you can eat, and things you have to chase down and pummel before you can eat.', 'Both guide and guard on open plain.', "Even when fate is already written, there's always time to change the names.", 'Every elf in Shadowmoor is charged from birth with a terrible duty: to strike back against the ugliness and darkness, even though they are all around and seemingly without end.', "Goblins journey to the sacrificial peaks in pairs so that the rare survivor might be able to relate the details of the other's grisly demise.", 'If your flesh can withstand the flame, the spirit of the dragon will burn within your soul.', "In the erupting heart of Bogardan, it's hard to tell hurtling volcanic rocks from pouncing volcanic beasts.", 'It hardly weighs anything, but it takes all day to remove.', 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', "Knight-stewards guard the Sun-Dappled Court, a grove of immense, sculptured olive trees that represent Valeron's twelve noble families.", 'Like so many Thran relics, the wurm engine kept operating long after its creators were gone.', 'Only those gifted with the eye of Ugin, the spirit dragon, can see his fiery breath.', 'Out of the blackness and stench of the engulfing swamp emerged a shimmering figure. Only the splattered armor and ichor-stained sword hinted at the unfathomable evil the knight had just laid waste.', 'Sometimes primitive cultures attributed natural phenomena to monsters. Sometimes they were right.', 'The knights are a major attraction at every Lammastide festival. Teams of riders perform daring feats of flight to the delight of all below.', 'The mysterious purpose of two of the rings had eluded Esper mages—until now.', 'The oil sloshes against his skull as he nears his destination: the Frogtosser Games and the lighting of the Flaming Boggart.', 'The skyhunters were born when the first leonin gazed at the heavens and wished to hunt the birds overhead.', 'Those who survive the test bear a mark of power anyone can recognize.', 'Though no longer attached to the hand, it still holds its adversary in its grasp.', 'To protect the alliance between Kjeldor and Yavimaya, they trained in the ways of both.', 'When giants find their mountain homes infested, they have a whole range of solutions.']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Ciruelo', 'Clint Langley', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Glen Angus', 'Goran Josic', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jason Chan', 'Jean-Sébastien Rossbach', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'Keith Garletts', 'Kev Walker', 'Larry Elmore', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Koelsch', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Ploog', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pat Lee', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Rob Alexander', 'Scott Bailey', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott Hampton', 'Steve Ellis', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Stuart Griffin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'William Simpson', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
