rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a plains or forest card if you do not want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counters are put onto the creature at the same time the damage is prevented. If a 1/1 creature would be dealt 6 damage, 3 damage is prevented and three +1/+1 counters are put on the creature. The creature ends up as a 4/4 creature with 3 damage marked on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-07-15\', \'text\': "The creature doesn\'t enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. It enters the battlefield, then the ability triggers. If either that creature or Juniper Order Ranger leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the remaining creature will still get a +1/+1 counter."}]', "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Ghostfire is colorless in all zones. Its damage comes from a colorless source.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the targeted nonland permanent forever.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no nonland permanents on the battlefield other than an Oblivion Ring, and the card it exiled was another Oblivion Ring, casting a third Oblivion Ring will result in an involuntary infinite loop that will end the game in a draw (unless someone chooses to break it by putting another nonland permanent onto the battlefield or destroying one of the Oblivion Rings, for example).'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything, but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled forever.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you control no Mountains as you cast Jaws of Stone, the number of targets must be zero.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The amount of damage is locked in as you cast Jaws of Stone. It won’t change, even if the number of Mountains you control changes.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You divide the damage among the targets as you cast Jaws of Stone. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Activating the ability that turns it into a creature while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power and/or toughness to a specific number. However, any effect that raises or lowers power and/or toughness (such as the effect created by Giant Growth, Glorious Anthem, or a +1/+1 counter) will continue to apply.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Knight of the White Orchid\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The Plains you search for doesn\'t have to be basic. For example, you could put a Sacred Foundry onto the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Edge of Autumn checks how many lands you control as it resolves. If you control five or more lands, it simply does nothing as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature becomes an illegal target by the time Sigil Blessing resolves, the entire spell won’t resolve. Your other creatures won’t get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being basic landcycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a basic landcycling ability from being activated.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with basic landcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Unlike the normal cycling ability, basic landcycling doesn’t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a basic land card. You don’t choose the type of basic land card you’ll find until you’re performing the search. After you choose a basic land card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You can choose not to find a basic land card, even if there is one in your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Voracious Dragon can devour any type of creatures, not just Goblins.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': '“The number of Goblins it devoured” means “The number of Goblins sacrificed as a result of its devour ability as it entered the battlefield.” For each creature that Voracious Dragon devoured, this ability checks its creature type as it last existed on the battlefield to see if it was a Goblin at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'The number of untapped creatures you control is counted as the ability resolves, and the bonus is locked in at that time. By this point, other attacking creatures will already be tapped (unless they have vigilance).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'After Harm’s Way resolves, it no longer checks to see if the target is a legal target. However, if that permanent or player can’t be dealt damage at the time the chosen source would deal damage (perhaps because the creature is no longer on the battlefield or is no longer a creature, or because the player is no longer in the game), the damage can’t be redirected. It’s dealt to the original recipient.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As you cast Harm’s Way, you target that the redirected damage will be dealt to. As Harm’s Way resolves, you choose a source of damage. You never choose the original recipient of the damage; Harm’s Way will apply to whatever the chosen source tries to deal damage to, as long as it’s you or a permanent you control.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Harm’s Way has no effect on damage that’s already been dealt.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the chosen source would deal just 1 damage to you or a permanent you control, Harm’s Way’s effect will redirect that damage and still have a “shield” left for another 1 damage from that source later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the chosen source would simultaneously deal damage to multiple permanents you control (like Pyroclasm could) or to you and at least one permanent you control (like Earthquake could), Harm’s Way will redirect just 2 of that damage. It won’t redirect the next 2 damage that would be dealt to each recipient. You choose which 2 damage is redirected. If you like, you can choose to redirect 1 damage that would be dealt by the chosen source to each of two different recipients.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Punishing Fire has left your graveyard by the time its triggered ability resolves, you may still pay {R}, but you won’t return it to your hand. This is true even if Punishing Fire has left your graveyard and returned to it by the time its triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Punishing Fire’s triggered ability triggers only if it’s already in your graveyard at the time an opponent gains life. For example, you can cast it in response to a spell or ability that will cause an opponent to gain life. In that case, Punishing Fire will resolve first, so it will be in the graveyard by the time the opponent gains life. However, if you wait until an opponent actually gains life and then cast Punishing Fire, you won’t be able to return it to your hand at that time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You choose whether to pay {R} as the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a red spell, Dragon’s Claw’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Dragon’s Claw’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a red spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If an effect would simultaneously destroy Knight Exemplar and another Knight creature you control, only Knight Exemplar is destroyed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If another Knight creature you control is dealt lethal damage, the creature isn\'t destroyed, but the damage remains marked on it. If, at some point later in that turn, you no longer control Knight Exemplar or it loses its abilities, the other Knight creature will lose indestructible and will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If you control two Knight Exemplars, each one causes the other to get +1/+1 and have indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Lethal damage, damage from a source with deathtouch, and effects that say “destroy” won\'t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it\'s sacrificed, if it\'s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Only Shiv’s Embrace’s controller (who is not necessarily the enchanted creature’s controller) can activate its activated ability.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'When Shiv’s Embrace’s activated ability resolves, the creature Shiv’s Embrace is enchanting at that time will get +1/+0 (regardless of what creature Shiv’s Embrace was enchanting when the ability was activated). If Shiv’s Embrace has left the battlefield by then, the creature it was enchanting at the time it left the battlefield will get +1/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each of the three targets must be different. If there aren’t three different legal targets available, you can’t cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one or two of Cone of Flame’s targets are illegal when it resolves, you can’t change how much damage will be dealt to the remaining legal targets.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want to affect what can block the creature, you must cast Mighty Leap during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Knight of the Reliquary’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 2/2 creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'If the fourth (or more) time Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated during the same turn happens to be during that turn’s end step, the delayed triggered ability won’t trigger until the beginning of the next turn’s end step. You’ll have to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at that time.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'The first three times Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated in a turn will do nothing other than give it +1/+0 until end of turn. Any subsequent activations will also cause its delayed triggered ability to trigger. That means if you activate Dragon Whelp’s ability five times, for example, two different delayed triggered abilities will trigger at the beginning of the next end step and cause you to sacrifice Dragon Whelp.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If the fourth (or subsequent) time Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated during the same turn is during that turn’s end step, the delayed triggered ability won’t trigger until the beginning of the next turn’s end step. You’ll have to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at that time.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'There’s no limit to the number of times you can activate Dragon Whelp’s ability in a turn. However, the fourth activation in a turn and each subsequent activation will cause a delayed triggered ability that will force you to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Griffin Guide and the enchanted creature go to the graveyard at the same time, Griffin Guide’s last ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Skirk Prospector’s activated ability, including Skirk Prospector itself. Note that once you sacrifice Skirk Prospector, you won’t be able to activate its ability again, so if you’d like to sacrifice multiple Goblins including Skirk Prospector for mana, be sure to sacrifice Skirk Prospector last.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Baumwipfeldorf\', \'text\': \'Das Baumwipfeldorf kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Das Baumwipfeldorf wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 grünen Menschenaffe-Kreatur, die Trampelschaden verursacht. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243782&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5d082c-06e7-470d-b721-455679359576\', \'multiverseId\': 243782}, \'multiverseid\': 243782}, {\'name\': \'Aldea en las copas\', \'text\': \'La Aldea en las copa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{1}{G}: La Aldea en las copas se convierte en una criatura Simio verde 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16a883c2-7567-4d86-a616-5092fc30b631\', \'multiverseId\': 244110}, \'multiverseid\': 244110}, {\'name\': \'Village arboricole\', \'text\': "Le Village arboricole arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\\n{1}{G} : Le Village arboricole devient une créature 3/3 verte Grand singe avec le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9faea934-be6c-494f-aa22-49f675669353\', \'multiverseId\': 243864}, \'multiverseid\': 243864}, {\'name\': \'Villaggio Arboricolo\', \'text\': \'Il Villaggio Arboricolo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{1}{G}: Il Villaggio Arboricolo diventa una creatura Scimpanzé 3/3 verde con travolgere fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e668615-1ec8-4468-96a0-6c75b76be0fb\', \'multiverseId\': 243946}, \'multiverseid\': 243946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalischer Lanzenträger\', \'text\': \'Bonus {2}{W} (Du kannst zusätzlich {2}{W} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFalls du die Bonuskosten bezahlt hast, kommt der Benalische Lanzenträger mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel und hat Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33539ef5-9a4c-4b45-9cdf-6436cc3810d5\', \'multiverseId\': 243756}, \'multiverseid\': 243756}, {\'name\': \'Lancero benalita\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {2}{W}. (Puedes pagar {2}{W} adicionales en cuanto lances este hechizo.)\\nSi el Lancero benalita fue estimulado, entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él y con la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04aa03df-f94e-4189-b444-a69aacc8b94f\', \'multiverseId\': 244084}, \'multiverseid\': 244084}, {\'name\': \'Lancier bénalian\', \'text\': "Kick {2}{W} (Vous pouvez payer {2}{W} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nSi le Lancier bénalian a été kické, il arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, deux marqueurs +1/+1, et avec l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8400557-2991-410a-8260-65eddd61c1c7\', \'multiverseId\': 243838}, \'multiverseid\': 243838}, {\'name\': \'Lanciere di Benalia\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {2}{W} (Puoi pagare {2}{W} addizionale quando lanci questa magia.)\\nSe il Lanciere di Benalia è stato potenziato, entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1 e con attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ffdb39-5af8-4d60-af0b-5ffa64140233\', \'multiverseId\': 243920}, \'multiverseid\': 243920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berittener Alaborn\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Berittene Alaborn angreift, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich ist er weggelaufen! Dieser Anblick hätte mir auch nicht gefallen!"\\n—Loddar, Alabornsoldat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243762&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47743b16-5895-4f14-97e1-30faec321f33\', \'multiverseId\': 243762}, \'multiverseid\': 243762}, {\'name\': \'Caballero de Alaborn\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Caballero de Alaborn ataque, puedes girar la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por supuesto que corrió! ¡Yo tampoco querría estar mirando esa arma de frente!"\\n—Soldado de Alaborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb1317b-7266-4b70-94a0-11ab34382d12\', \'multiverseId\': 244090}, \'multiverseid\': 244090}, {\'name\': "Cavalier d\'Alaborn", \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Cavalier d\'Alaborn attaque, vous pouvez engager une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr qu\'il a pris la fuite ! Je ne voudrais pas non plus me retrouver face à ça ! »\\n—Soldat d\'Alaborn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302361c1-e36a-460a-bbc7-404df9f2cf99\', \'multiverseId\': 243844}, \'multiverseid\': 243844}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere Pesante Alaborn\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Cavaliere Pesante Alaborn attacca, puoi TAPpare una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Certo che è scappato! Neanche io avrei voluto fissare quella canna!"\\n—Soldato Alaborn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a91d45eb-0178-470f-a199-d7ced7cfde7e\', \'multiverseId\': 243926}, \'multiverseid\': 243926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestrafendes Feuer\', \'text\': \'Bestrafendes Feuer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner Lebenspunkte dazuerhält, kannst du {R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe Bestrafendes Feuer aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9964dd16-9a34-4c28-82d7-4a47e2b36cb7\', \'multiverseId\': 243810}, \'multiverseid\': 243810}, {\'name\': \'Fuego castigador\', \'text\': \'El Fuego castigador hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nSiempre que un oponente gane vida, puedes pagar {R}. Si lo haces, regresa el Fuego castigador de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720c39bc-3f1b-42de-ad09-450c17763eef\', \'multiverseId\': 244138}, \'multiverseid\': 244138}, {\'name\': \'Feu punitif\', \'text\': "Le Feu punitif inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire gagne des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {R}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez le Feu punitif depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4cbf3b-00b0-4fe9-aef2-0f8bdddd2d8d\', \'multiverseId\': 243892}, \'multiverseid\': 243892}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Punitivo\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Punitivo infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario guadagna punti vita, puoi pagare {R}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano il Fuoco Punitivo dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93929a18-ba4b-4489-8371-ad98a2c9397e\', \'multiverseId\': 243974}, \'multiverseid\': 243974}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzeichen-Mentor\', \'text\': \'Rote Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Boggarts teilen alles auf der Welt in zwei Kategorien ein: Sachen, die man essen kann, und Sachen, die man jagen und tothauen muss, bevor man sie essen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8359c2-f685-424f-920c-a4dd242e4236\', \'multiverseId\': 243794}, \'multiverseid\': 243794}, {\'name\': \'Mentor marca de sangre\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas rojas que controlas tienen la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los boggarts dividen el mundo en dos categorías: las cosas que puedes comer y las cosas que debes atrapar y golpear antes de poder comerlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35555b25-5519-4602-adfc-7bb399cd84f8\', \'multiverseId\': 244122}, \'multiverseid\': 244122}, {\'name\': \'Mentor marquesang\', \'text\': "Les créatures rouges que vous contrôlez ont l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les boggarts divisent le monde en deux catégories : ce qui est mangeable, et ce qui doit être chassé et attendri avant de pouvoir être mangé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a32d9d-994a-4399-994f-00443338e6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 243876}, \'multiverseid\': 243876}, {\'name\': \'Mentore dal Marchio di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Le creature rosse che controlli hanno attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'I boggart dividono il mondo in due categorie: cose che puoi mangiare e cose che devi scovare e colpire più volte prima di poterle mangiare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1cc646e-a910-4ddf-a736-78e531127def\', \'multiverseId\': 243958}, \'multiverseid\': 243958}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Bogardanische Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb8402b-ca89-402e-a984-dcf93d46c625\', \'multiverseId\': 243791}, \'multiverseid\': 243791}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Bogardan entre al campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier número de criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5eb3655-5170-425f-b791-421216b0f418\', \'multiverseId\': 244119}, \'multiverseid\': 244119}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer du Bogardân arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb8ad7f-31bf-457e-8966-31c4d06be7f0\', \'multiverseId\': 243873}, \'multiverseid\': 243873}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni suddivisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33edc499-1360-46a3-8ae2-3eee7df26b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 243955}, \'multiverseid\': 243955}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243783&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6480b68-20d2-4d22-8b33-8172ba4588d9', 'multiverseId': 243783}, 'multiverseid': 243783}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244111&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33019363-37b1-41d5-90af-f9c9e43d9abd', 'multiverseId': 244111}, 'multiverseid': 244111}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243865&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd30a06e2-ef94-4b3e-a646-47204cbda801', 'multiverseId': 243865}, 'multiverseid': 243865}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243947&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f19fea05-6b80-49d6-8799-2b71238e1dd1', 'multiverseId': 243947}, 'multiverseid': 243947}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243784&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '720749cf-ff71-4bb5-9db0-cc2468a547bc', 'multiverseId': 243784}, 'multiverseid': 243784}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244112&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83412e0e-4139-466d-b04d-e7e70ebd9411', 'multiverseId': 244112}, 'multiverseid': 244112}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243866&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aab90cd1-02bf-472f-8d7d-38e48f42304a', 'multiverseId': 243866}, 'multiverseid': 243866}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243948&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2aed9de4-0f93-4d8a-9aad-57164301a0db', 'multiverseId': 243948}, 'multiverseid': 243948}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243785&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '349975fd-fc4e-40ad-a287-c60cd986e011', 'multiverseId': 243785}, 'multiverseid': 243785}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244113&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97894073-e738-40c9-8705-6ced3ff861f1', 'multiverseId': 244113}, 'multiverseid': 244113}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243867&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed68adb4-7534-47fc-b70a-5ce9b89d83e1', 'multiverseId': 243867}, 'multiverseid': 243867}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243949&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50abb6a5-81bd-44c6-9cd7-283c37580cbd', 'multiverseId': 243949}, 'multiverseid': 243949}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243786&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aa0ffce-c87e-47b0-847f-ba031558b841', 'multiverseId': 243786}, 'multiverseid': 243786}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244114&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e86b5ff2-e127-47df-984a-50f4a1d1a73b', 'multiverseId': 244114}, 'multiverseid': 244114}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243868&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5341d759-b323-45bf-baa0-d77e0710463a', 'multiverseId': 243868}, 'multiverseid': 243868}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243950&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '414ecd14-9d98-4e5f-ada3-01a1e07129a2', 'multiverseId': 243950}, 'multiverseid': 243950}]", "[{'name': 'Feuriger Fall', 'text': 'Feuriger Fall fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland, zeige es offen vor und nimm es auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jund weidet sich an den Unvorbereiteten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243820&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8909a20-88af-451a-a5b1-1d2535b2f72c', 'multiverseId': 243820}, 'multiverseid': 243820}, {'name': 'Caída ardiente', 'text': 'La Caída ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nCiclo de tierra básica {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Jund disfruta con los sorprendidos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244148&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c54552c-b291-4a67-8dbf-d50051b3fa4c', 'multiverseId': 244148}, 'multiverseid': 244148}, {'name': 'Chute ardente', 'text': 'La Chute ardente inflige 5 blessures à la créature ciblée.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Jund festoie des ingénus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243902&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76205969-10c6-41ee-a0a7-d7f405062f88', 'multiverseId': 243902}, 'multiverseid': 243902}, {'name': 'Rovina Impetuosa', 'text': 'La Rovina Impetuosa infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nCicloterra base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Jund banchetta con gli sprovveduti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243984&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49e82d50-d1aa-4338-96a4-f4b2ced7041e', 'multiverseId': 243984}, 'multiverseid': 243984}]", '[{\'name\': \'Flammenkegel\', \'text\': \'Der Flammenkegel fügt einer Kreatur/einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu, einer anderen Kreatur/einem anderen Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte und einer dritten Kreatur/einem dritten Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ae4cd9-5c58-4e42-8326-6871c5b238b9\', \'multiverseId\': 243819}, \'multiverseid\': 243819}, {\'name\': \'Cono de llamas\', \'text\': \'El Cono de llamas hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo, 2 puntos de daño a otra criatura o jugador objetivo y 3 puntos de daño a una tercera criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fe42d2-1462-491e-a4d8-5a8f5c95d0fe\', \'multiverseId\': 244147}, \'multiverseid\': 244147}, {\'name\': \'Cône de flammes\', \'text\': \'Le Cône de flammes inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur, 2 blessures à une autre cible, créature ou joueur, et 3 blessures à une troisième cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7ef185-1c38-4bf3-b524-af113e53efd2\', \'multiverseId\': 243901}, \'multiverseid\': 243901}, {\'name\': \'Cono di Fiamme\', \'text\': "Il Cono di Fiamme infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio, 2 danni a un\'altra creatura o a un altro giocatore bersaglio e 3 danni a una terza creatura o a un terzo giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'338ddefd-698f-4786-85e5-edae19c3ae1d\', \'multiverseId\': 243983}, \'multiverseid\': 243983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtloser Einzelgänger\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{4}{W}: Der Furchtlose Einzelgänger erhält +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Petschaft ist kein Symbol von Macht. Es zeigt nur an, dass du Verstärkung brauchst. Aber was machst du jetzt, Gilden-Ratte? Außer mir und meinem Schwert ist niemand in der Nähe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee304747-fb57-4ef3-8a8a-0dc6e216d575\', \'multiverseId\': 243747}, \'multiverseid\': 243747}, {\'name\': \'Disidente corazón de león\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{4}{W}: El Disidente corazón de león obtiene +1/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu sello no es un símbolo de poder. Sólo marca tu necesidad de que te ayuden otros. ¿Que harás ahora, rata de gremio, que te enfrentas solo a mi espada?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addb9e42-318d-48a1-83e5-d7005a5d1689\', \'multiverseId\': 244075}, \'multiverseid\': 244075}, {\'name\': \'Dissident au cœur de lion\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{4}{W} : Le Dissident au cœur de lion gagne +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Ton cachet n\'est pas un symbole de pouvoir. Il indique simplement que tu dois t\'aider de chiffres. Que vas-tu faire, rat de guilde, à présent que tu te retrouves seul face à ma lame ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ebb391-a2a8-4ebc-8bf7-12bd63c3e567\', \'multiverseId\': 243829}, \'multiverseid\': 243829}, {\'name\': \'Dissidente Cuordileone\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{4}{W}: Il Dissidente Cuordileone prende +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tuo sigillo non è un simbolo di potere. Evidenzia solo il tuo bisogno di farti aiutare. Che cosa pensi di fare, ratto delle gilde, ora che dovrai affrontare da solo la mia lama?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada93feb-f2aa-4051-8984-40f05e875b70\', \'multiverseId\': 243911}, \'multiverseid\': 243911}]', "[{'name': 'Führung des Greifen', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und Flugfähigkeit.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe einen 2/2 weißen Greifenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243777&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00a390e0-5393-4044-b621-588e9ae3dd87', 'multiverseId': 243777}, 'multiverseid': 243777}, {'name': 'Guía de grifos', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nCuando la criatura encantada vaya a un cementerio, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Grifo blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244105&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcf6b6cb-73fa-417e-813f-7d1cfcb965bc', 'multiverseId': 244105}, 'multiverseid': 244105}, {'name': 'Guide griffon', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol.\\nQuand la créature enchantée est mise dans un cimetière, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Griffon avec le vol.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243859&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2e93a14-cb26-4050-8901-14eea477208e', 'multiverseId': 243859}, 'multiverseid': 243859}, {'name': 'Guida dei Grifoni', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha volare.\\nQuando la creatura incantata viene messa in un cimitero, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Grifone 2/2 bianca con volare.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243941&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4a8c057-72d9-4989-9302-c60fe52ccf26', 'multiverseId': 243941}, 'multiverseid': 243941}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243822&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9645c2cb-fdfe-4a1c-8ddf-6c5fe3af0af9', 'multiverseId': 243822}, 'multiverseid': 243822}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244150&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f288e432-7ee6-473b-a968-7456a3bfa165', 'multiverseId': 244150}, 'multiverseid': 244150}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243904&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77498b66-c2db-4e84-84f7-47637df1364d', 'multiverseId': 243904}, 'multiverseid': 243904}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243986&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee0770c1-6e1b-4a29-a8d6-1d402d1b51e3', 'multiverseId': 243986}, 'multiverseid': 243986}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243823&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acdd0671-7475-4126-b2f7-f5ab4e504477', 'multiverseId': 243823}, 'multiverseid': 243823}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=244151&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '150b7eaf-6508-4e1e-8168-b6f8bf3e693c', 'multiverseId': 244151}, 'multiverseid': 244151}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=243905&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71e62c1e-a7ac-4959-a1e7-2fefe538af30', '