 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', 'Amplify 3 (As this creature enters the battlefield, put three +1/+1 counters on it for each Dragon card you reveal in your hand.)\\nFlying\\n{T}: Kilnmouth Dragon deals damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to target creature or player.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type at all times.)\\n{R}: Fire-Belly Changeling gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate this ability no more than twice each turn.', 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to target creature or player, 2 damage to another target creature or player, and 3 damage to a third target creature or player.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 and have reach. (They can block creatures with flying.)', 'Defender\\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", 'Dragon spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each Mountain you control and has first strike.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\\nWhen enchanted creature is put into a graveyard, put a 2/2 white Griffin creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', 'Exile target creature that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', 'First strike, lifelink', 'First strike, protection from black', 'First strike, protection from red', 'First strike\\nOther Knight creatures you control get +1/+1 and are indestructible.', 'First strike\\nWhen Knight of the White Orchid enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Target Knight creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Bogardan Rager enters the battlefield, target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Bogardan Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike', 'Flying\\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhen Voracious Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target creature or player equal to twice the number of Goblins it devoured.', 'Flying\\nWhen Thunder Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}: Mordant Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhenever Mordant Dragon deals combat damage to a player, you may have it deal that much damage to target creature that player controls.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}: Shivan Hellkite deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', 'G', 'Ghostfire is colorless.\\nGhostfire deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'Grasslands enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Grasslands: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', 'If you control four or fewer lands, search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.\\nCycling—\\nSacrifice a land. (Sacrifice a land, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Jaws of Stone deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players, where X is the number of Mountains you control as you cast Jaws of Stone.', 'Kicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell.)\\nBreath of Darigaaz deals 1 damage to each creature without flying and each player. If Breath of Darigaaz was kicked, it deals 4 damage to each creature without flying and each player instead.', 'Kicker {2}{W} (You may pay an additional {2}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nIf Benalish Lancer was kicked, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it and with first strike.', 'Knight creatures you control have double strike.', 'Knight of the Reliquary gets +1/+1 for each land card in your graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Forest or Plains: Search your library for a land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.', 'Level up {2} ({2}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n2/2\\n\\nLEVEL 5+\\n5/5\\nFirst strike', 'Level up {2}{W} ({2}{W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-4\\n3/6\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n4/8\\nOther creatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n2/3\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\nFlying, vigilance', 'Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn, and put a +1/+1 counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way.', 'Punishing Fire deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nWhenever an opponent gains life, you may pay {R}. If you do, return Punishing Fire from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Put two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'R', 'Red creatures you control have first strike.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Add {R} to your mana pool.', 'Seismic Strike deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W} to your mana pool.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target player gains 7 life.', 'The next 2 damage that a source of your choice would deal to you and/or permanents you control this turn is dealt to target creature or player instead.', "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Untap target creature with power less than the number of cards in your graveyard and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Until end of turn, target creature you control gets +3/+3 and other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\\n{4}{W}: Lionheart Maverick gets +1/+2 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', 'W', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Whenever Alaborn Cavalier attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever Knotvine Paladin attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each untapped creature you control.', 'Whenever Paladin of Prahv deals damage, you gain that much life.\\nForecast — {1}{W}, Reveal Paladin of Prahv from your hand: Whenever target creature deals damage this turn, you gain that much life. (Activate this ability only during your upkeep and only once each turn.)', 'Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature and a +1/+1 counter on Juniper Order Ranger.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', '{2}: Henge Guardian gains trample until end of turn.', '{R}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.']
